<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第二幕 · HARNESS 里头</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>拦住：把对错变成机器能判的关卡</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "column", gap: 20}}><Box style={{height: 250, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 12}}><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 72, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23", textAlign: "center"}}>工具调用</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 72, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23", textAlign: "center"}}>协议检查</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 72, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23", textAlign: "center"}}>验证门禁</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 72, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "#0F6E56", textAlign: "center"}}>放行 / 拒绝</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "center", marginTop: 14}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>↓ 在离错误源头最近的地方就地拦下 ↓</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 262, flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "stretch"}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 22, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56"}}>可执行契约</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>把测试当成可执行契约——写了测试，「对错」就从讨论变成了运行</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 22, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>同一道门禁</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>你们本来就有一道变更门禁——现在让 agent 的动作也走同一道</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>19 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
